  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDF Grant for Internal Audit Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed grant will support the Turkish Government in the implementation of the new internal audit framework as stipulated in the Public Financial Management and Control Law. The grant will focus on the establishment of a quality assurance and improvement program and building capacity in the internal audit system.  TF093782 Grant closed early at country&apos;s request. The objective of the grant is to strenghten the capacity of the public sector internal audit in Turkey by assisting the Internal Audit Central Harmonization Unit (IACHU) of Turkey to fully implement the Public Financial Management and Control Law. This project would provide critical funding and technical assistance to the IACHU to support it in its role in the implementation of the new internal audit framework.</narrative>
  </description>
